---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Platform Services | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Blooming Systems Inc. provides identity platform services to help organizations operate, maintain, integrate, and continuously improve enterprise identity environments."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">PLATFORM SERVICES</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <h1>
            Keep identity platforms
            <span>working for the business.</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Identity platforms require continuous attention after
              implementation. We help organizations operate, maintain,
              integrate, and improve identity technology across its lifecycle.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact/" class="button">Discuss platform services <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">BEYOND IMPLEMENTATION</p>
          <h2>Identity is an operating capability, not a one-time project.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Identity platforms change continuously as applications are added,
            organizations evolve, security requirements change, and cloud
            adoption increases.
          </p>
          <p>
            Sustainable identity operations require clear ownership, reliable
            processes, platform expertise, and continuous improvement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">PLATFORM CAPABILITIES</p>
        <h2>Operate the identity environment with <span>discipline and visibility.</span></h2>

        <div class="grid">
          <article><strong>01</strong><h3>Platform Administration</h3><p>Support ongoing configuration, administration, and maintenance of identity platforms.</p></article>
          <article><strong>02</strong><h3>Application Onboarding</h3><p>Establish repeatable processes for integrating applications into the identity environment.</p></article>
          <article><strong>03</strong><h3>Policy Management</h3><p>Maintain authentication, access, and identity policies as requirements evolve.</p></article>
          <article><strong>04</strong><h3>Operational Support</h3><p>Address platform issues, integration dependencies, and operational requirements.</p></article>
          <article><strong>05</strong><h3>Optimization</h3><p>Identify opportunities to simplify, automate, and improve identity operations.</p></article>
          <article><strong>06</strong><h3>Lifecycle Management</h3><p>Plan platform changes, upgrades, migrations, and ongoing architectural evolution.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">OPERATING MODEL</p>
        <h2>Make identity operations <span>repeatable and measurable.</span></h2>

        <div class="steps">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>Monitor</h3><p>Understand platform health, integrations, dependencies, and operational signals.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Maintain</h3><p>Keep configurations, policies, integrations, and platform components current.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Support</h3><p>Resolve issues and maintain reliable identity services for users and applications.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Improve</h3><p>Identify automation, simplification, and architectural improvement opportunities.</p></article>
          <article><span>05</span><h3>Evolve</h3><p>Adapt the platform as business, security, and technology requirements change.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">KEEP IDENTITY MOVING</p>
        <h2>Build an operating model that lets your identity platform <span>evolve with the business.</span></h2>
        <a href="/contact/" class="button">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page{color:var(--color-text)}.container{width:min(var(--container),calc(100% - (var(--gutter)*2)));margin:auto}.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 24px;color:var(--color-blue);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--color-blue)}.hero{padding:180px 0 130px;background:#eef4ff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:100px;align-items:end}.hero h1{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,88px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:650}.hero h1 span,h2 span{display:block;color:var(--color-blue)}.hero-copy{max-width:520px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;min-height:52px;margin-top:28px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--color-blue);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:650}.section{padding:120px 0}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:100px}.split h2,h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,62px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:650}.prose{max-width:700px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.dark-section{padding:120px 0;background:var(--color-ink)}.dark-section h2{color:white;max-width:900px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:65px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}.grid article{padding:38px;min-height:250px;background:var(--color-ink)}.grid strong,.steps span{color:var(--color-blue);font-size:11px}.grid h3{margin:40px 0 15px;color:white;font-size:22px}.grid p{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:60px}.steps article{padding:30px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border)}.steps h3{margin:42px 0 14px;color:var(--color-ink)}.steps p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.cta{padding:120px 0;background:#eef4ff;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}.cta h2{max-width:1000px}@media(max-width:1000px){.hero-grid,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:640px){.hero{padding:130px 0 90px}.section,.dark-section,.cta{padding:85px 0}.grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,65px)}}
</style>